From 69da76c85066baceb42363305f9924eb34c7b1ef Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Fri, 23 Oct 2026 07:32:17 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] Fix K20 stuck "jammed" state, rename DP33 to Passage Mode,
 opt-in keep-connected

- lock: clear a stale jammed flag when the lock later reaches the commanded
  state, changes state on its own, or a new command is sent; add per-product
  jam_timeout (K20: 90 s, others unchanged at 12 s)
- switch: DP 33 on the K20 is passage mode (stays unlocked), not auto-lock
- K20 can use the "Keep connected" option (status-request keep-alive), needed
  for alarm/doorbell/unlock-ID event data points; these entities are now
  disabled by default
- docs and en/cs translations updated

Co-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01M4FXkLhoGUcLZ3Bf91EKfe
