-| 33 | `automatic_lock` | bool | auto lock |
+| 33 | `automatic_lock` | bool | passage mode (stays unlocked) |
 | 46 | `manual_lock` | bool | remote lock |
 | 47 | `lock_motor_state` | bool | lock state |
 | 71 | `ble_unlock_check` | raw | remote unlock |
